      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Bula, this is Liam, in for Bear. The riff skill watches before it speaks. You hand it a local clip, a Remotion scene, or a rendered artifact. It probes the thing, inspects frames and the event sequence, then writes commentary grounded in what visibly happens — not what the filename suggests.",
