    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "VERDICT",
      "narration_text": "The verdict. Riff is the skill that earns its claims. Look first — probe the artifact, inspect frames, keep timecodes. Evidence second — footage carries the evidence, voice carries the verdict. Record everything — RIFF.md keeps observations separate from inferences, failures included. And: never call a scripted route a human playtest. Four rules. One epistemic discipline.",
